province = 55
blurb = "Depicts two female travelers and a porter carrying their boxes, passing by rice fields in the early morning. Two red-crowned cranes are pecking at the rice stalks behind them.

The background is dominated by the huge snowy mass of Mount Fuji, its loftiness highlighted by extending beyond the frame of the print.

Hara was a smaller post town on the coast of Suruga Bay between Numazu and Yoshiwara. The area is in present-day Numazu, Shizuoka prefecture."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
